<Callout kind="warn">
The original incident's “one issue, one fix queued” is not supported by its own rendered cause table.
Two date-format mechanisms need separate fixes. Body-level timing exceptions need investigation;
the desk still files and counts them under the parser cause. No fix has been verified by this export.
